# Claude Code plugin marketplaces baked into the image, one per line:
#
#   <name>  <git url>  <commit>
#
# <name>    directory name under /opt/claude-plugins/marketplaces
# <commit>  pinned; refresh every line with ./build_image --update-plugins
#
# Every plugin a marketplace declares with an in-repo source is exposed and
# loads enabled in every session. To keep one off by default, name it in
# claude/plugins.blocklist. Plugins sourced from another repo are skipped —
# vendor them by adding that repo here as its own marketplace.

